  "packageHash": "r2i2kSFeaN4iIJ37Vkd2x0bUgC5RLs0PsyhSiEoci6XhVyOrPncRwwhRzSGv6LkOZhvFL0mhcvEm0JTuFqvajQ==",
  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 590327,
  "projectUrl": "https://github.com/jecacs/SolSharp",
  "published": "2026-07-02T21:57:06.31Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.0 — first stable release; the public API is now covered by the semver compatibility promise (breaking changes only with a major version). The client covers the full current Solana JSON-RPC HTTP read surface, adding getBlockCommitment, getBlockProduction, getBlockTime, getBlocksWithLimit, getEpochSchedule, getFirstAvailableBlock, getGenesisHash, getHighestSnapshotSlot, getIdentity, getInflationGovernor, getInflationRate, getLargestAccounts, getMaxRetransmitSlot, getMaxShredInsertSlot, getRecentPerformanceSamples, getSlotLeader, getStakeMinimumDelegation, getTokenAccountsByDelegate, and minimumLedgerSlot — each typed, documented, and tested. All JSON is source-generated (no reflection) and every assembly is Native AOT compatible. Changelog: https://github.com/jecacs/SolSharp/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
